#DESCRIPTION
Hybrid-PIC absorbing-field-wall test: a spatially localised Gaussian Alfven
pulse (AlfvenPulse testcase) is seeded at the center of a finite-x domain whose
x faces are ABSORBING (Mur characteristic) field boundaries and REFLECTING
particle boundaries.  Both +/-x wave packets propagate out of the domain and
are absorbed cleanly without reflection.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-3.2                    xMin
 3.2                    xMax
-0.05                   yMin
 0.05                   yMax
-0.05                   zMin
 0.05                   zMax

#NCELL
64                      nCellX
1                       nCellY
1                       nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
16                      maxBlockSizeX
1                       maxBlockSizeY
1                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
F                       isPeriodicX
T                       isPeriodicY
T                       isPeriodicZ

#FIELDBOXBOUNDARY
absorb                  fieldBoxBoundaryLo
absorb                  fieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi

Reflecting particle walls keep the ions inside the cavity while fields absorb.
#PARTICLEBOXBOUNDARY
reflect                 particleBoxBoundaryLo
reflect                 particleBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi

#SOLVEEM
F                       solveEM

#HYBRIDPIC
T                       useHybridPIC

#HALLTERM
T                       useHallTerm

#BSUBCYCLE
8                       nBSubcycle

#RESISTIVITY
0.0                     etaResistivity

#ELECTRONTEMPERATURE
0.0                     electronTemperature
1.0                     electronGamma
1.0                     electronDensity0

#PLASMA
1                       nSpecies
1.0                     mass
1.0                     charge

#UNIFORMSTATE
5.0                     rho
0.0                     ux
0.0                     uy
0.0                     uz
1.0                     T
1.0439e-8               bx
0.0                     by
0.0                     bz
0.0                     ex
0.0                     ey
0.0                     ez

#TESTCASE
AlfvenPulse

#WAVEIC
0.10                    frac
0.6                     gaussWidth

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
0.01                    dt

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI
1.0e5                   uNormSI

#MONITOR
100                     dnReport

#SAVELOG
10                      dnSavePic
10                      dnSavePT

#PARTICLES
256                     npcelx
1                       npcely
1                       npcelz

#SAVEPLOT
1                       nPlot
z=0 var ascii pic       plotString
100                     dn
-1                      dt
1                       dx
rhoS0 uxS0 uyS0 uzS0 Bx By Bz Ex Ey Ez   plotVar

#STOP
-1                      MaxIter
12.0                    TimeMax
